### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/health
Accept: application/json

###

### ── Basic Gift Query (Core Use Case) ───────────────────────────────────────
### Agent will: searchProducts → checkInventory → getPersonalizedRecommendations
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I need a gift under ₦20,000 for a 5-year-old",
  "userId": "U001",
  "cartId": "CART-001",
  "sessionId": "session-demo-1"
}

###

### ── Check Stock for a Specific Product ─────────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Is the LEGO Classic Brick Box in stock?",
  "userId": "U001",
  "sessionId": "session-demo-1"
}

###

### ── Ask About Discounts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Do you have any discount codes available?",
  "userId": "U001",
  "cartId": "CART-001",
  "sessionId": "session-demo-1"
}

###

### ── Apply Discount Code ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Apply the KIDS20 discount code to my cart please",
  "userId": "U001",
  "cartId": "CART-001",
  "sessionId": "session-demo-1"
}

###

### ── Educational Toys with Budget ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I'm looking for educational toys under ₦10,000",
  "userId": "U002",
  "sessionId": "session-demo-2"
}

###

### ── Personalized Recommendations ──────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Can you recommend something based on what I've bought before?",
  "userId": "U001",
  "sessionId": "session-demo-1"
}

###

### ── Guest User Query ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Show me the best toys you have for kids",
  "userId": "GUEST",
  "sessionId": "session-guest"
}

###

### ── Clear Session ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shopping/session/session-demo-1
Accept: application/json
